From 6db9bbc9c90bd1ec89ec0d1e4b1118c8a58c5276 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Sat, 27 Jun 2026 04:39:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add syscall tracer and unify boot VFS with linux_compat path

- Hook INT 0x80 dispatch_syscall with serial syscall tracing (pid, args,
  return/errno, fd-table dump on fd-related failures)
- Call vfs::init() at boot before legacy fs::init(); mount /proc and /dev
  on the syscall-facing VFS (null, zero, urandom, console, tty)
- Route read/write through special_fd for pipes, eventfd, sockets
- Extend ramfs directories to hold arbitrary InodeOps (device nodes)
